      <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/josueluna/LinkedIn_to_Sheets/main/public/logo.png" alt="LinkedIn to Sheets logo">
      <span>LinkedIn to Sheets</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="index.html#how">See How It Works</a>
      <a href="index.html#features">Features</a>
      <a href="index.html#demo">Demo</a>
      <a href="changelog.html">Changelog</a>
      <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="#">
      Start Saving LinkedIn Profiles Now
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ── Hero ── -->
<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg">
    <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-text reveal">
      <div class="beta-pill glass">
        <span class="dot-wrap">
          <span class="dot-ping"></span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
        </span>
        Now in private beta
      </div>
      <h1>
        LinkedIn to Google Sheets Chrome Extension
        <span class="gradient-text">Save LinkedIn profiles in one click — no more copy-paste</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Built by recruiters who got tired of this:
      </p>

      <p class="workflow-line">
        Open profile → copy → switch tab → paste → repeat
      </p>

      <p class="lead">
        Hundreds of times a week. So we fixed it.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn-primary lg" href="#beta">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><line x1="21.17" y1="8" x2="12" y2="8"></line><line x1="3.95" y1="6.06" x2="8.54" y2="14"></line><line x1="10.88" y1="21.94" x2="15.46" y2="14"></line></svg>
          Get Early Access
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="btn-glass" href="#how">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <p class="fineprint">
        No data stored · Works with any Google account · No setup required
      </p>
      <p class="fineprint" style="opacity:0.8;">
        Used by recruiters sourcing hundreds of candidates weekly
      </p>
      <p class="fineprint" style="margin-top:0.25rem;">
        Takes less than 30 seconds to get started
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual reveal">
      <div class="frame video-frame">
        <video autoplay="" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" preload="auto" poster="media/preview.png" style="
        width:100%;
        border-radius:0.75rem;
        display:block;
        object-fit:cover;">
        <source src="media/demo-lts.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Problem / Solution ── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container ps-grid">
    <div class="reveal lift card-pad glass">
      <div class="icon-chip dest">✕</div>
      <h3>The problem</h3>
      <p class="card-text">
        You know the drill:
        open profile → copy → switch tab → paste → repeat.
        Hundreds of times a week.

        It’s slow, repetitive, and honestly — a terrible use of a recruiter’s time.
      </p>
      <ul class="bullet-list">
        <li><span class="bullet-x">·</span> Switching tabs over and over</li>
        <li><span class="bullet-x">·</span> Typos and inconsistent formatting</li>
        <li><span class="bullet-x">·</span> Duplicate candidates slipping through</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal lift card-pad solution-card">
      <div class="icon-chip prim">
        <svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>The solution</h3>
      <p class="card-text">
        LinkedIn to Sheets removes the most repetitive part of sourcing.
        You stay on LinkedIn — the data goes where it needs to go.
        No friction, no switching tabs, no manual errors.
      </p>
      <ul class="bullet-list">
        <li><span class="bullet-ok">✓</span> One click captures the full profile</li>
        <li><span class="bullet-ok">✓</span> Customisable column mapping</li>
        <li><span class="bullet-ok">✓</span> Warns you if the candidate already exists</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── How it works ── -->
<section id="how" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>From profile to spreadsheet in four steps</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">No setup headaches, no API keys. Just install, connect, and start sourcing faster.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:0ms">
        <div class="step-head">
          <div class="step-icon prim"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><line x1="21.17" y1="8" x2="12" y2="8"></line><line x1="3.95" y1="6.06" x2="8.54" y2="14"></line><line x1="10.88" y1="21.94" x2="15.46" y2="14"></line></svg></div>
          <span class="step-num">Step 01</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Install the extension</h3>
        <p>Add LinkedIn to Sheets from the Chrome Web Store in seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:60ms">
        <div class="step-head">
          <div class="step-icon prim"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"></line><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="16" y2="17"></line></svg></div>
          <span class="step-num">Step 02</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Connect Google Sheets</h3>
        <p>Sign in with Google and pick the spreadsheet and tab you want to fill.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step linkedin glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:120ms">
        <div class="step-head">
          <div class="step-icon linkedin"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle><path d="M7 21v-2a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v2"></path></svg></div>
          <span class="step-num">Step 03</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Open any LinkedIn profile</h3>
        <p>Browse LinkedIn the way you always do. The extension reads the profile in view.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:180ms">
        <div class="step-head">
          <div class="step-icon prim"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 9l5 12 1.8-5.2L21 14z"></path><path d="M7.2 2.2 8 5.1"></path><path d="m5.1 8-2.9-.8"></path><path d="M14 4.1 12 6"></path><path d="m6 12-1.9 2"></path></svg></div>
          <span class="step-num">Step 04</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Click 'Paste Profile'</h3>
        <p>Name, company, title, location and profile URL land in the right columns instantly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Features ── -->
<section id="features" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Features</p>
      <h2>Everything you need to source faster</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Thoughtful details that compound over hundreds of profiles a week.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:0ms">
        <div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div>
        <h3>One-click capture</h3>
        <p>Reads the LinkedIn profile you're viewing and writes a clean row to your sheet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:50ms">
        <div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="21" y1="4" x2="14" y2="4"></line><line x1="10" y1="4" x2="3" y2="4"></line><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line><line x1="21" y1="20" x2="16" y2="20"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="3" y2="20"></line><line x1="14" y1="2" x2="14" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="10" x2="8" y2="14"></line><line x1="16" y1="18" x2="16" y2="22"></line></svg></div>
        <h3>Custom column mapping</h3>
        <p>Decide exactly which column receives Name, Company, Title, Location and Profile URL.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:100ms">
        <div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"></polyline><polyline points="1 20 1 14 7 14"></polyline><path d="M3.51 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.85-3.36L23 10"></path><path d="M20.49 15a9 9 0 0 1-14.85 3.36L1 14"></path></svg></div>
        <h3>Duplicate detection</h3>
        <p>Already added that candidate? You'll be warned with the row number — no double entries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:150ms">
        <div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline></svg></div>
        <h3>Multi-sheet support</h3>
        <p>Switch between spreadsheets and tabs from the popup. Great for active pipelines.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:200ms">
        <div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div>
        <h3>Privacy-first</h3>
        <p>Your data stays between your browser, your Google account and your sheets.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:250ms">
        <div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.9 5.8a2 2 0 0 1-1.3 1.3L3 12l5.8 1.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.3 1.3L12 21l1.9-5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.3-1.3L21 12l-5.8-1.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.3-1.3z"></path></svg></div>
        <h3>Built for recruiters</h3>
        <p>Designed around real sourcing workflows — fast, focused, no bloat.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Demo ── -->
<section id="demo" class="section">
  <div class="container demo-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">See it in action</p>
      <h2>The popup that does the boring work</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">A clean interface lives inside your browser. Connect Google, pick a spreadsheet, choose a tab, and paste the profile you're looking at — all from one focused popup.</p>
      <ul class="demo-list">
        <li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg><span>Search across all your spreadsheets</span></li>
        <li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg><span>Pick the destination tab in one click</span></li>
        <li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg><span>Configure custom column mapping</span></li>
        <li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg><span>Refresh the active profile anytime</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-visual reveal">
