      GitHub
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Page Hero -->
<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg">
    <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="page-hero-inner reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="page-title"><span style="background: var(--gradient-brand); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;">Privacy Policy</span></h1>
    <p class="page-sub">How LinkedIn to Sheets handles your data — Short version: your data stays in your browser and your Google account — nowhere else.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Content -->
<div class="content-wrap">
  <hr class="divider">

  <div class="privacy-grid reveal">

    <div class="privacy-card glass lift">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle><path d="M7 21v-2a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v2"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>What we collect</h3>
      <p>Only publicly available LinkedIn profile information — name, job title, company, location, and profile URL — and only when you actively trigger the extension.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-card glass lift">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>How it's used</h3>
      <p>Captured data is used exclusively to populate the Google Sheet you select. Nothing else — no analytics, no profiling, no secondary use.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-card glass lift">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>No external storage</h3>
      <p>No data is stored externally, sold, or shared with third parties. All processing occurs locally within the extension and your own Google account.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-card glass lift">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>What we never touch</h3>
      <p>The extension does not collect sensitive personal data, financial data, or authentication credentials of any kind.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cta-band glass-strong reveal" style="background: var(--glass-strong-bg); backdrop-filter: saturate(160%) blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(160%) blur(20px); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
    <div class="cta-bg">
      <div class="cta-orb-1"></div>
      <div class="cta-orb-2"></div>
    </div>
    <h2>Questions about your data?</h2>
    <p>We're happy to answer any privacy questions directly. Reach out via the support form.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn-primary lg" href="https://forms.gle/xmCiUB8Tzs3ocM616" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
        Contact Support
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
      </a>
      <a class="btn-glass" href="https://josueluna.github.io/LinkedIn_to_Sheets/changelog.html">Changelog</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/josueluna/LinkedIn_to_Sheets/main/public/logo.png" alt="">
      <span>LinkedIn to Sheets</span>
    </div>
    <p>Built by <a class="link" href="https://github.com/josueluna" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Josué Luna</a></p>
    <a class="gh" href="https://github.com/josueluna/LinkedIn_to_Sheets" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path></svg>
      GitHub
